# The libc++ slice (spec/bench.md "The libcxx-slice entry"): heavy libc++
# tests, paths relative to the llvmorg-22.1.8 libcxx/test checkout that
# `cargo xtask libcxx` uses. Each is compiled at -fsyntax-only with the
# flags the libc++ runner gives it. Selected only by naming this directory:
#   cargo xtask bench --compare-with clang++-22 bench/libcxx-slice
# Seeded from 48 sema-heavy libc++ 19 tests (WP-317); one was removed in 22:
#   vector.cons/assign_copy.addressof.compile.pass.cpp -> assign_copy.pass.cpp
